ment does not provide a guarantee of subsequent Call Off Contracts to be awarded. The Contracting Authority does not guarantee business through this Framework Agreement. Transport for London (TfL) has undertaken this procurement on behalf of the Greater London Authority and any Framework Agreements awarded may be also used by the GLA Group."},{"field_id":"TED-INFO_ADD","lang":"EN","ordinal":1,"type":"text","value":"It is anticipated that the value of the lots could be approximately as follows:"},{"field_id":"TED-INFO_ADD","lang":"EN","ordinal":2,"type":"text","value":"Lot 1: from 15 % to 20 % of the value of the whole framework."},{"field_id":"TED-INFO_ADD","lang":"EN","ordinal":3,"type":"text","value":"Lot 2: from 20 % to 25 % of the value of the whole framework."},{"field_id":"TED-INFO_ADD","lang":"EN","ordinal":4,"type":"text","value":"Lot 3: from 50 % to 55 % of the value of the whole framework."},{"field_id":"TED-INFO_ADD","lang":"EN","ordinal":5,"type":"text","value":"Lots 4 to 7 – each from 0,5 % to 2 % of the value of the whole framework."},{"field_id":"TED-INFO_ADD","lang":"EN","ordinal":6,"type":"text","value":"This is a competitive procurement conducted in accordance with the Public Contracts Regulations 2006."},{"field_id":"TED-INFO_ADD","lang":"EN","ordinal":7,"type":"text","value":"Transport for London (TfL) will incorporate a standstill period of at least 10 calendar days when information on the award of the Framework Agreement(s) is communicated to tenderers. This period allows unsuccessful tenderers to seek further debriefing from TfL before the Framework Agreement(s) is entered into. Applicants have two working days from notification of the award to request additional debriefing and that information has to be provided a minimum of 3 working days before expiry of the standstill period. If an appeal regarding the award of a Framework Agreement(s) has not been successfully resolved, the Public Contracts Regulations provide for aggrieved parties who have been harmed or are at risk of harm by a breach of the rules to take action to the High Court (England, Wales and Northern Ireland). Any such action must be brought promptly (generally within 3 months). If a Framework Agreement has been entered into, the court may only award damages.The standstill period has been adhered to and is now concluded."},{"field_id":"TED-INFO_ADD","lang":"EN","ordinal":8,"type":"text","value":"Address of the other contracting authority on behalf of which the contracting authority is purchasing:"},{"field_id":"TED-INFO_ADD","lang":"EN","ordinal":9,"type":"text","value":"Official name: Greater London Authority."},{"field_id":"TED-INFO_ADD","lang":"EN","ordinal":10,"type":"text","value":"Postal address: City Hall, The Queen's Walk."},{"field_id":"TED-INFO_ADD","lang":"EN","ordinal":11,"type":"text","value":"Town: London Postal code: SE1 2AA."},{"field_id":"TED-INFO_ADD","lang":"EN","ordinal":12,"type":"text","value":"Country: United Kingdom."},{"code":"01","field_id":"TED-INITIATOR","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"UK","field_id":"TED-ISO_COUNTRY","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"EN","field_id":"TED-LG_ORIG","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"TED-LOT_DIVISION","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"code":"8","field_id":"TED-MA_MAIN_ACTIVITIES","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"4","field_id":"TED-NC_CONTRACT_NATURE","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"TED-NOTICE_NUMBER_OJ","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"ojs","type":"id","value":"2013/S 180-311093"},{"code":"THIS_PROCEDURE","field_id":"TED-NOTICE_NUMBER_OJ.PREV_KIND","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"TED-NO_CONTRACT_COVERED_GPA","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"field_id":"TED-NO_DOC_OJS","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"2018/S 113-257590"},{"field_id":"TED-NO_OJ","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":113},{"code":"79600000","field_id":"TED-ORIGINAL_CPV","